      "body": "# Machine Learning Zoomcamp\n\nDocumentation for the Machine Learning Zoomcamp course.\n",
      "body_sha256": "09fb1c36c6e9eff9972a510b2093b8e1bd89670fffba0a549e0cc2343dca896c",
      "description": "Synthetic Machine Learning Zoomcamp page.",
      "edit_url": "https://example.invalid/edit/courses/ml-zoomcamp/index.md",
