      "title": "Machine Learning Zoomcamp"
    },
    {
      "body": "# Curriculum\n\n## Modules\n\n[Module 1: Introduction](https://github.com/DataTalksClub/machine-learning-zoomcamp/tree/main/01-intro)\n\n- Setup, basic Python\n- NumPy, Pandas intro\n\nModule 2: Machine Learning for Regression\n\n- Linear regression basics\n\nModule 3: Machine Learning for Classification\n\n- Logistic regression\n\nModule 4: Evaluation Metrics for Classification\n\n- Accuracy and confusion matrix\n\nModule 5: Deploying Machine Learning Models\n\n- Flask and Docker\n\nModule 6: Decision Trees and Ensemble Learning\n\n- Random forest, XGBoost\n\nModule 7: Neural Networks and Deep Learning\n\n- TensorFlow, Keras\n\nCapstone Project\n\n- Build and deploy an end-to-end ML project\n\n## Learning Philosophy\n\nHands-on, project-based learning drives every module.\n\n## Pace\n\nSelf-paced with optional cohort support.\n\n## Cohort Changes\n\nCohorts run periodically; content evolves each year based on community feedback.\n",
      "body_sha256": "47b670dadea3eac433f156b7e186d4a9bb56d69b968374ac4a693efa9146ffe1",
      "description": "Synthetic Curriculum page.",
      "edit_url": "https://example.invalid/edit/courses/ml-zoomcamp/curriculum.md",
      "grand_parent": null,
      "grand_parent_path": null,
      "has_children": false,
      "has_toc": false,
      "nav_order": 1,
      "parent": "Machine Learning Zoomcamp",
      "parent_path": "/docs/courses/ml-zoomcamp/",
      "permalink": null,
      "public_path": "/docs/courses/ml-zoomcamp/curriculum/",
      "source_path": "courses/ml-zoomcamp/curriculum.md",
      "source_revision": "3f23e006ffdaa498bbc69697408853b6f5eb37dc",
      "title": "Curriculum"
    },
